					"documentation" : "@dev Issue unsold token to `target` address.\r\n The math is as follows:\r\n   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n   |       Total Ethers Received        |                        |\r\n   +------------------------------------+  Unsold Token Portion  |\r\n   |   Lower Bound   |   Upper Bound    |                        |\r\n   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n   |      50,000     |     60,000       |         67.5%          |\r\n   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n   |      60,000     |     70,000       |         65.0%          |\r\n   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n   |      70,000     |     80,000       |         62.5%          |\r\n   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n   |      80,000     |     90,000       |         60.0%          |\r\n   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n   |      90,000     |    100,000       |         57.5%          |\r\n   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n   |     100,000     |    110,000       |         55.0%          |\r\n   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n   |     110,000     |    120,000       |         52.5%          |\r\n   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n   |     120,000     |                  |         50.0%          |\r\n   +-------------------------------------------------------------+\r",
